{
  "slug": "groundwork",
  "name": "Groundwork",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Groundwork is a structured development workflow plugin that guides you from product requirements through architecture, implementation, and validation. It provides 28 skills and 22 commands covering product design (EARS requirements), architecture decision-making, test-driven development, systematic debugging, and multi-agent validation. Features include worktree-isolated task execution, parallel adversarial debugging with agent swarms, 9-agent validation loops, spec synchronization, and monorepo support. Groundwork encodes development best practices into guided workflows so nothing gets skipped.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **41 skills**, **18 agents** and **4 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (41): `build-unplanned` (Build a feature from description with worktree isolation and TDD), `check-specs-alignment` (Verify alignment between code and specs), `create-tasks` (Generate implementation tasks from architecture document), `debug` (This skill should be used when investigating bugs, unexpected behavior, test failures, or any code that does not…), `design-architecture` (This skill should be used when the user asks to design system architecture, make architectural decisions, or translate…), `design-it-twice` (Use before committing to a non-trivial module, service boundary, or public API - generate 2-3 divergent interface designs,…), `design-product` (Create detailed product requirements document (PRD) for a feature), `domain-modeling` (Use when designing a product or feature and the project lacks shared, agreed terminology - builds and maintains…), and 33 more\n- **Agents** (18): `architecture-alignment-checker`, `architecture-task-alignment-checker`, `cloud-infrastructure-reviewer`, `code-quality-reviewer`, `code-simplifier`, `conventions-reviewer`, `design-consistency-checker`, `design-task-alignment-checker`, and 10 more\n- **Hooks** (4): `SessionStart`, `PostToolUse`, `SubagentStop`, `PreCompact`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install groundwork@claude-community` from `etr/groundwork`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 41,
    "agent": 18,
    "hook": 4
  },
